# GRG K-coefficients & Tbilisi 14-39

When a project sits inside the Tbilisi land-use plan it must satisfy the
K1 / K2 / K3 / FAR coefficients defined in the Sakrebulo ordinance
**14-39** (with consolidations + amendments **41**, **57**, **59**, **4-13**)
that live under
`C:\Users\PCZONE.GE\Downloads\wetransfer_03_xref_saproeqto_2026-04-29_1038\kanonmdebloba\`.

## Definitions

| Symbol | Meaning | Formula |
|---|---|---|
| **K1** | building-footprint coefficient (`განაშენების კოეფიციენტი`) | Σ ground-floor building footprint / parcel area |
| **K2** | total built-up coefficient | Σ all building footprints (incl. canopies, balconies > 1.5 m) / parcel area |
| **K2-1** | gross floor-area coefficient (= FAR) | Σ above-ground gross floor area / parcel area |
| **K3** | landscape / green coefficient (`გამწვანების კოეფიციენტი`) | green-cover area / parcel area |
| **K3-1** | natural-soil green coefficient | natural-ground green / parcel area |
| **FAR** | floor-area ratio | usually equals K2-1 |

`Parcel area` = polygon on layer
`New_ნაკვეთების კონტურები გრგ2_*` (or `xref_sakutreba`).

## Typical Tbilisi residential thresholds

> Always read the actual ordinance for the parcel’s **functional zone**
> (FZ-…). The numbers below are typical defaults — re-check against
> `14-39.pdf`, `41.pdf`, `57.pdf`, `59.pdf` for the specific FZ.

| Functional zone | K1 max | K2-1 max (FAR) | K3 min | Storey limit |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| LR-1 (low-rise residential) | 0.30 | 0.6 – 0.9 | 0.50 | 3 |
| LR-2 | 0.40 | 1.2 | 0.40 | 4 |
| MR (mid-rise residential) | 0.50 | 2.0 – 2.5 | 0.30 | 6 – 9 |
| HR (high-rise residential) | 0.50 | 3.5 – 5.5 | 0.25 | 12 – 24 |
| MX (mixed) | 0.55 | varies | 0.20 | varies |
| RC (recreation) | 0.10 | 0.10 | 0.85 | 1 |

## Setbacks (`უკუ-დახრები`)

| Direction | Default minimum |
|---|---|
| Front (street) | 5 m or matches red line |
| Side | h / 2 (where *h* = building height) |
| Rear | h / 2 |
| Building-to-building (same parcel) | h (the taller of the two) |

## Computing K coefficients in LISP

Pseudocode for `compute-grg-k.lsp`:

```
(setq parcel  (vlax-curve-getarea (entget (car (entsel "\nparcel:")))))
(setq footprint 0.0)
(foreach b (ssget-list-on-layer "WALL")
   (setq footprint (+ footprint (vlax-curve-getarea b))))
(setq K1 (/ footprint parcel))
(setq FAR (* K1 floors))   ; floors = number of stories
```

