## Reference cluster (from `STAGE_PLAN_REPORT.md`)

The 10-bina B-type cluster has:

- envelope ≈ 535 m²
- 1 floor ≈ 658.4 m² gross above-ground (ground-floor only)
- if N floors: gross = 658.4 × N

To pass MR zoning the parcel needs to be **≥ 1 070 m²** (gives K1 ≈ 0.50).
For 4-storey use the parcel must be **≥ 1 050 m²** (gives FAR ≈ 2.5).

## Accessibility cross-checks

Per `N41 dadgenileba shezguduli...pdf`:

- ramp slope ≤ 1 : 12 (8.3 %)
- accessible door clear opening ≥ 900 mm
- accessible WC ≥ 1.65 × 1.80 m
- pavement / threshold step ≤ 14 mm

Our default 800 mm interior door fails the accessibility threshold; flag
it on every report.
